"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "巴實抹（Bashemath）",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "巴實抹Bashemath",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<h1>巴實抹（Bashemath）*</h1><ol><li><p>有英文譯本在<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen26:34\">創世記二十六章34節</a>將巴實抹（Basemath）拼寫為巴實抹（Bashemath）。她是以掃的妻子之一。<em>見</em><span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"3190\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">巴實抹（Basemath） #1</span>。</p></li><li><p>有英文譯本在<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen36:3\">創世記三十六章3節</a>將巴實抹（Basemath）拼寫為巴實抹（Bashemath）。她也是以掃的妻子之一，又名瑪哈拉。<em>見 </em><span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"6034\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">瑪哈拉（人物）#1</span>。</p></li></ol>",
